obj_id: agentGenerated_FridaySales15ImprovementProjection-8321d88d
liveboard:
  name: agentGenerated_Friday Sales 15% Improvement Projection
  visualizations:
  - id: Viz_1
    viz_guid: aa8ed570-9466-4e5a-92e1-ee0f8cab11d8
    note_tile:
      html_parsed_string: |-
        Key Drivers:
        • Q4 dominance generates 38% of annual revenue vs 16% in Q1
        • November ($352K) and December ($325K) create clear holiday shopping surge
        • Sunday leads weekly sales at $411K while Friday drops to lowest at $186K
        • February consistently weakest month across all years at only $60K

        Recommendations:
        • Stock inventory heavily before Q4 and concentrate marketing spend September-November
        • Launch weekend promotions targeting Saturday-Sunday peak shopping periods
        • Deploy promotional campaigns in January-February to counter seasonal slowdown
